{"id":"23bff36940dfb355","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization.md","title":"Uniform Arithmetical Completeness","display":"thm-uniform-solovay-realization — Uniform Arithmetical Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization","aliases":["89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization"],"display":"thm-uniform-solovay-realization — Uniform Arithmetical Completeness","depends_on":["[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-uniform-solovay-realization — Uniform Arithmetical Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"be68cce492414c6b\" href=\"?note=be68cce492414c6b\" title=\"89-thm-solovay-theorem\">89-thm-solovay-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>标准 PA 可证明性实现及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为单模态定理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为全部普通 PA 结构实现。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\exists\\tau_0\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\n(A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau_0(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\exists\\tau_0\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\n(A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau_0(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 132–137；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n原书的统一算术完全性定理：用可计算枚举的一列有限 GL 反模型形成统一构造。量词次序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\tau_0\\,\\forall A\">\\(\\exists\\tau_0\\,\\forall A\\)</span>，严格强于逐公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\,\\exists\\tau\">\\(\\forall A\\,\\exists\\tau\\)</span> 反解释。\n同样的单一实现不能把 GLS 的定理性刻画为“标准模型真”：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(p)\">\\(\\tau(p)\\)</span> 或其否定有一个为真，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\neg p\">\\(p,\\neg p\\)</span> 都非 GLS 定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-solovay-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\exists\\tau_0\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\n(A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau_0(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\tau_0\\,\\forall A","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\,\\exists\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(p)","display":false},{"tex":"p,\\neg p","display":false}],"bytes":1436,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]] → [[89-lem-solovay-limit-properties]] → [[89-lem-solovay-truth]] → [[89-lem-solovay-lem2]] → [[89-thm-solovay-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-companion]] → [[89-thm-gls-completeness]] → [[89-cor-gls-decidable]] → [[89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization]]"}],"outgoing":["be68cce492414c6b","1f581262c09d5e34"]}